meta {
  name: Wander fix
  type: http
  seq: 42
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sim/wander?deviceId={{deviceId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  200 { wander:true, free, lat, lon, speed, course, anchor, seededFrom }

  Seed priority: browser anchor (seededFrom "anchor"), else this boat's
  own newest stored point ("last-fix"), else the newest point in the DB
  ("last-fix-any"). 404 only when the DB is empty entirely.

  With no browser anchor the walk is seeded ONCE and then goes free, so a
  stale fix cannot leash the boat to an old mooring. The DB is consulted
  only on a boat's first poll, never on the 1Hz path.
}
